  F3 --> C{"C · Compare on<br/>Drug + MedDRA term<br/>On label?"}
  L3 --> C
  C -- "Yes (Nausea)" --> N["No signal"]
  C -- "No + reported often<br/>(NAION, PRR high)" --> S["SIGNAL<br/>'reported, not on label'<br/>evidence: FAERS query + report IDs,<br/>label setid + version + sections"]
  C -- "Not a reaction<br/>(Off label use)" --> T["Tagged, not ranked"]
  S --> W["Safety officer triage<br/>→ TriageDecision (write-back)"]
